WEBVTT

00:26.583 --> 00:30.583
ALL CHARACTERS, EVENTS, OR LOCALES
IN THIS MOVIE ARE FICTITIOUS.

00:30.666 --> 00:36.500
ANY RESEMBLANCE IS ENTIRELY COINCIDENTAL.

00:39.500 --> 00:42.333
In this world,
we all have to make a choice

00:42.416 --> 00:44.500
between light and darkness.

00:45.250 --> 00:47.458
But how many of us can choose wisely?

01:40.000 --> 01:41.333
15 YEARS AGO

01:41.416 --> 01:43.041
From the moment I was born,

01:43.125 --> 01:45.000
I have been destined for darkness.

01:45.083 --> 01:47.458
Mommy, when is dinner ready?

01:48.125 --> 01:50.583
I'm hungry.

01:50.666 --> 01:53.291
Mommy, when is dinner ready?

01:53.375 --> 01:55.958
-Okay, okay. I heard you.
-Mommy?

01:56.041 --> 01:57.833
This is fucking annoying! I'm done!

01:57.916 --> 01:59.791
-Come on, honey.
-Fucking mood killer!

01:59.875 --> 02:01.500
Come on! Continue!

02:02.625 --> 02:04.208
-I'm not in the mood anymore!
-Honey!

02:04.291 --> 02:05.416
Here's your money!

02:05.500 --> 02:06.750
You just leave me for good?

02:06.833 --> 02:08.791
-I'm getting it somewhere else!
-Honey!

02:28.000 --> 02:29.166
Bi, let's eat.

02:34.083 --> 02:37.166
I've paid the tuition for you.
When you go to school tomorrow,

02:37.750 --> 02:40.541
be sure and make a good impression
on your teachers and classmates, okay?

02:42.708 --> 02:44.250
I don't want to go to school.

02:50.083 --> 02:51.541
They said I'm crazy.

02:54.750 --> 02:55.958
You're not crazy.

02:56.791 --> 02:57.625
Bi.

02:57.708 --> 02:58.583
Hear me out.

02:59.458 --> 03:00.500
You are…

03:01.375 --> 03:02.791
a very special child.

03:05.583 --> 03:09.583
We are all born equal. What makes us
different are the choices we make.

03:09.666 --> 03:12.750
If you study hard,
we will get out of this situation.

03:12.833 --> 03:13.875
All right?

03:32.166 --> 03:34.666
Lai, where are you? Tell her to come out!

03:34.750 --> 03:36.250
It's your favorite customer!

03:39.750 --> 03:43.375
Where's your mother? Go get her!
Tell her it's her main man!

04:07.875 --> 04:10.375
Get off me! Get off me!

04:17.416 --> 04:20.250
Keep screaming,
and I'll kill you and your mother!

04:20.333 --> 04:21.833
Shut your hole!

04:51.458 --> 04:52.416
Fuck you!

04:53.083 --> 04:54.541
You fucking bitch!

04:56.875 --> 04:57.916
Fuck you!

04:58.000 --> 05:00.583
Fuck you, two bitches!

05:00.666 --> 05:02.250
Fuck! I'll kill you!

05:02.333 --> 05:03.583
Fuck you!

05:05.583 --> 05:07.541
Fuck you, bitches!

05:09.916 --> 05:11.250
Bitch!

05:11.333 --> 05:12.375
You pieces of shit!

05:12.458 --> 05:13.708
I'll kill you both!

05:24.625 --> 05:26.083
Mom…

05:26.833 --> 05:27.958
Mom!

06:06.083 --> 06:10.000
I thought I'd reached the dream,
which is full of light.

06:10.083 --> 06:13.083
But now everything was burnt to ashes.

06:14.291 --> 06:16.000
Without a family

06:16.083 --> 06:18.000
and a place to call home,

06:18.083 --> 06:20.166
I took the last bus

06:20.250 --> 06:23.208
leaving behind this place
and the scent of its burning grass.

06:35.583 --> 06:38.250
Banh mi, anyone?

06:38.333 --> 06:39.166
Here. Thanks.

06:39.250 --> 06:44.125
-Mrs. Nam, I need another bowl over here!
-Banh mi, anyone?

06:44.208 --> 06:45.916
Banh mi!

06:49.916 --> 06:52.166
Bitch! Did you forget whose turf this is?

07:00.625 --> 07:01.625
Fuck!

07:12.125 --> 07:15.333
Hey! Stop! Go get her!

07:17.291 --> 07:19.416
Fate still holds me down

07:19.500 --> 07:21.625
and drowns me in despair.

07:22.208 --> 07:23.083
Pull her up!

07:26.458 --> 07:29.000
You fucking bitch!
Did you forget whose turf this is?

07:33.375 --> 07:36.541
A piece of trash like you
is gonna end up being a whore!

07:36.625 --> 07:38.833
Press her down! You're so fucked, bitch!

07:48.166 --> 07:49.875
I'll be back for you!

07:49.958 --> 07:51.083
Until…

07:51.625 --> 07:52.791
she appeared.

07:54.666 --> 07:56.416
The woman that had been through death.

07:58.333 --> 07:59.583
A girl at your age

07:59.666 --> 08:02.000
sleeping on the streets

08:02.083 --> 08:04.083
is easy prey for those bastards.

08:09.333 --> 08:10.708
Can I come with you?

08:10.791 --> 08:12.416
I'll do whatever you want.

08:45.166 --> 08:46.208
-Hey, Tam.
-Yes.

08:47.708 --> 08:48.958
-One bowl over there.
-Okay.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.875
Ms. Lin, hello.

08:51.958 --> 08:52.791
Good.

08:52.875 --> 08:53.875
-Sau.
-Lin.

08:53.958 --> 08:55.750
-One bowl for me, please.
-Grab a seat.

08:55.833 --> 08:58.166
Last night there was another disturbance

08:58.250 --> 09:00.166
in downtown area.

09:00.250 --> 09:03.250
This is the fourth one this month…

09:03.333 --> 09:05.083
According to local residents,

09:05.166 --> 09:06.750
at about 10:00 p.m.,

09:06.833 --> 09:08.208
a group of young men

09:08.291 --> 09:11.333
armed with machetes,
knives, and other weapons

09:11.416 --> 09:14.166
were fighting from…

09:14.250 --> 09:17.000
Your old injury acts up in this weather.

09:17.083 --> 09:18.333
But you keep drinking…

09:19.250 --> 09:20.083
Right?

09:20.166 --> 09:22.250
And you never go to see a doctor.

09:22.333 --> 09:24.208
The medicine will no longer work one day.

09:27.375 --> 09:29.416
So, another homeless kid.

09:29.500 --> 09:31.708
How many do you intend to collect, Lin?

09:31.791 --> 09:33.583
I'm not any different from them, Sau.

09:36.166 --> 09:38.666
Jeez, you're covered in blood.

09:42.541 --> 09:43.458
Damn!

09:44.041 --> 09:45.791
What filthy hands!

09:46.625 --> 09:47.916
What's your name?

09:48.750 --> 09:49.750
Hey, is she mute?

09:49.833 --> 09:51.625
Can she talk?

09:51.708 --> 09:55.250
Hey, what do people call you?

09:56.166 --> 09:57.166
"Whore."

09:57.250 --> 09:58.083
What?

09:58.166 --> 09:59.083
"Whore"?

09:59.916 --> 10:01.125
Nonsense!

10:01.208 --> 10:03.791
What did your mother call you?

10:06.791 --> 10:07.625
Bi.

10:07.708 --> 10:10.750
Okay, so your name is Bi.

10:11.416 --> 10:12.333
Jeez.

10:12.416 --> 10:13.791
Your name means "tragedy,"

10:13.875 --> 10:15.666
that's why…

10:15.750 --> 10:17.291
you look like a complete mess.

10:17.375 --> 10:19.583
Get her a new name, will ya?

10:19.666 --> 10:21.875
Something nice,
so she can get a brighter future.

10:21.958 --> 10:23.500
Chung, gai, banh gio.

10:34.791 --> 10:36.750
Slow night, huh? Can I get a freebie?

10:36.833 --> 10:38.166
Fuck off!

11:32.541 --> 11:36.000
Blown a kiss, for the endless memories

11:36.083 --> 11:37.625
Close the door.

11:38.583 --> 11:39.666
Who's this?

11:40.208 --> 11:41.750
The new girl. Her name is Bi.

11:42.250 --> 11:43.666
She will be staying with us.

11:44.833 --> 11:46.750
Put the noodles on the table for them.

11:47.916 --> 11:48.791
Want a drink?

11:49.541 --> 11:50.458
Aunt Lin?

11:50.541 --> 11:51.916
Look at her!

11:52.000 --> 11:53.291
How can she keep up with us?

11:54.000 --> 11:55.250
Give her a chance.

11:55.833 --> 11:57.791
All right, let's see how long she lasts.

11:57.875 --> 12:01.000
Hong, get her a place to sleep
and some clean clothes.

12:01.083 --> 12:01.958
Okay.

12:06.125 --> 12:07.791
Hey. I'm Hong.

12:07.875 --> 12:08.958
And that is Thanh.

12:09.875 --> 12:11.916
Where'd you come from? You look like shit.

12:13.833 --> 12:16.791
It's fun to have one more
joining the gang. Kind of cute.

12:17.583 --> 12:18.583
But a bit stinky.

12:18.666 --> 12:20.833
Here, have a drink.

12:24.291 --> 12:25.500
Listen.

12:25.583 --> 12:27.375
I don't care where you came from,

12:27.458 --> 12:29.166
but if you wanna stick around,

12:29.250 --> 12:30.708
you have to prove yourself.

12:30.791 --> 12:31.750
You hear me?

12:31.833 --> 12:35.041
My God! You're too ridiculous!

12:35.125 --> 12:36.791
She's just arrived!

12:36.875 --> 12:39.791
That's why no one wants
to make friends with you. Unbelievable.

12:39.875 --> 12:41.333
Let's go and get you cleaned up.

12:51.500 --> 12:52.791
Come here, you!

12:52.875 --> 12:54.375
Let me trim it for you.

13:06.458 --> 13:07.833
Try this!

13:11.250 --> 13:13.250
Come here and take a look!

13:14.375 --> 13:16.041
So cute!

13:16.833 --> 13:17.708
What's wrong?

13:22.875 --> 13:24.291
Jeez, look at you.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.083
So cute!

13:40.375 --> 13:42.375
It's not sexy at all!

13:42.458 --> 13:43.500
Ew!

14:07.250 --> 14:10.083
Stand up.
There is no room for weakness here.

14:10.166 --> 14:13.666
If you don't want men to push you around,
be stronger than them. Again!

14:19.250 --> 14:20.916
Find your opponent's weakness

14:21.000 --> 14:22.208
before you attack.

14:22.291 --> 14:24.166
Everything in your hand must be a weapon.

14:31.083 --> 14:32.166
Does it hurt?

14:33.000 --> 14:33.958
Ruthless.

14:34.041 --> 14:34.958
Poor her.

14:42.833 --> 14:44.541
I told you, she's too weak.

14:44.625 --> 14:46.375
Hong and I are enough.

14:46.458 --> 14:48.083
We don't need a weak one like this.

15:35.750 --> 15:37.416
Good. Very good.

15:44.750 --> 15:48.500
About earlier… thank you.
I have to admit, you're pretty crazy.

15:48.583 --> 15:51.166
I don't think I've ever met
anyone so stubborn.

15:51.250 --> 15:54.750
Drink.
This is your initiation into our group.

16:00.833 --> 16:03.666
-Aunt Lin, come eat with us, please.
-Okay.

16:06.958 --> 16:08.625
Here. Eat up, Bi.

16:09.625 --> 16:12.916
Everyone here has a past just like yours.
That fat bastard at the bridge

16:13.000 --> 16:15.583
is only one of the many depraved men
out there.

16:15.666 --> 16:18.458
So? You were raped? By how many?

16:21.958 --> 16:24.416
Was yours as wicked as mine? Mine was…

16:25.083 --> 16:26.208
three men at once.

16:26.291 --> 16:27.125
As for Thanh,

16:27.208 --> 16:29.500
she was sold into a brothel.

16:29.583 --> 16:31.375
Probably about ten per night.

16:31.458 --> 16:32.458
Assholes!

16:32.541 --> 16:35.541
That's what men are,
they look at women as toys.

16:35.625 --> 16:38.083
Our suffering just excites them.

16:38.166 --> 16:40.000
We can't count on anyone to protect us.

16:40.083 --> 16:41.416
We need to make a change!

16:41.500 --> 16:44.750
We must make those sickos feel our pain.

16:45.333 --> 16:47.333
Do you want to change that, Bi?

16:52.625 --> 16:53.666
Okay.

16:53.750 --> 16:56.750
Then you have to practice.
Practice until you are strong enough

16:56.833 --> 16:58.416
to end this injustice.

16:58.500 --> 16:59.500
Understand?

17:01.041 --> 17:02.666
And I know just where to start…

17:06.500 --> 17:09.250
Downtown, there's a crime ring
that sells women

17:09.333 --> 17:11.750
to rich men as sex slaves.

17:11.833 --> 17:13.625
We'll start there.

17:18.333 --> 17:20.208
They are known as "The Big Four,"

17:20.291 --> 17:22.041
terrorizing in every corner.

17:22.125 --> 17:24.333
Their leader is Hai, known as "Mad Dog."

17:24.416 --> 17:26.833
They control the nightlife downtown,

17:26.916 --> 17:27.916
sell drugs,

17:28.000 --> 17:30.625
throw these depraved raves
that last all night.

17:33.500 --> 17:34.666
Hai's territory is vast,

17:34.750 --> 17:36.500
but he's not without a lot of enemies.

17:43.333 --> 17:46.458
So far, though, none of them
could get past Hai's three musketeers.

17:46.541 --> 17:47.375
HALF-BLOOD SON

17:47.458 --> 17:49.916
"Half-blood" Son
is Hai's most trusted bodyguard.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.000
He's a quiet yet ruthless killing machine.

17:52.083 --> 17:55.083
Hai saved his life once,
so he has his utmost loyalty.

17:55.166 --> 17:56.958
If anyone lays a finger on Hai,

17:57.041 --> 17:58.458
Son will skin them alive.

18:08.208 --> 18:09.041
THE DEALER LONG

18:09.125 --> 18:11.291
"The Dealer" Long is Hai's right-hand man.

18:12.166 --> 18:13.625
He is calm and discreet.

18:13.708 --> 18:15.083
A thinking man.

18:15.166 --> 18:18.083
He is in charge of trafficking
and distributing drugs.

18:18.708 --> 18:20.833
They smuggle large amounts of drugs

18:20.916 --> 18:22.416
under the noses of the cops.

18:23.625 --> 18:24.458
Thanks, Boss!

18:31.291 --> 18:32.125
SCARFACE TEO

18:32.208 --> 18:34.833
"Scarface" Teo is the leader
of their sex trafficking ring.

18:34.916 --> 18:38.833
He manages the largest brothels
in Ma Lang, Cau Kho, and bus area.

18:44.750 --> 18:46.625
Then there's "Mad Dog" Hai himself.

18:47.333 --> 18:51.791
He was just a street rat, a pickpocket.
After joining Hoang Cathay's gang,

18:51.875 --> 18:54.416
he murdered Hoang's whole family
and became the boss.

18:55.666 --> 18:56.500
MAD DOG HAI

18:56.583 --> 18:59.041
A cruel, sinister,
and cold-blooded lowlife.

18:59.125 --> 19:02.083
For just a snort,
there's nothing you wouldn't do, right?

19:04.500 --> 19:06.458
What Hai loves most is money.

19:06.541 --> 19:07.375
Then, women.

19:07.458 --> 19:10.125
He personally manages
the biggest casino in downtown area

19:10.208 --> 19:12.083
that's open around the clock.

19:13.625 --> 19:14.458
Those leeches

19:14.541 --> 19:16.541
feed off our suffering like it's nothing.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.916
They are sadistic and inhumane

19:20.000 --> 19:21.875
and deserve to die one by one.

19:21.958 --> 19:24.041
We have to save the women

19:24.125 --> 19:25.958
who are suffering because of them

19:26.041 --> 19:28.000
and make them pay.

19:36.000 --> 19:36.833
So?

19:37.375 --> 19:38.625
Why are you looking for me?

19:42.250 --> 19:44.416
They embarrassed me with "Skinhead" Lam.

19:44.500 --> 19:46.750
Have you found out
who's behind the snakes?

19:46.833 --> 19:48.750
Huong and her fucking goons, no doubt.

19:48.833 --> 19:51.416
Those dirty "Portland" bastards.

19:51.500 --> 19:53.750
Destroy those motherfuckers.

19:54.708 --> 19:55.875
Let them know…

19:55.958 --> 19:58.291
it's not easy picking in this city.

19:58.875 --> 20:01.208
Hey! Did you hear anything
about some "A Thoong"?

20:03.416 --> 20:04.500
A Thoong.

20:04.583 --> 20:06.541
I heard he's new in Xom Cai.

20:06.625 --> 20:08.333
Did time for smuggling and murder.

20:08.416 --> 20:09.416
Just out of jail,

20:09.500 --> 20:12.291
he took out "Eight-Fingered" Thanh
and claimed his territory.

20:13.625 --> 20:14.791
Whoa.

20:16.041 --> 20:20.291
Those players are leveling up…
Send him some Chivas as a welcome gift.

20:20.375 --> 20:23.000
See if there's any business
we can do with him.

20:26.666 --> 20:28.125
Have a word with Teo…

20:28.208 --> 20:30.708
Tell him not to shit where he eats.

20:30.791 --> 20:32.916
He raped one of the new girls.

20:33.000 --> 20:34.291
We're businessmen,

20:34.375 --> 20:35.750
not fucking animals.

20:36.333 --> 20:37.333
So what?

20:38.708 --> 20:40.250
He's just testing the merchandise.

20:40.333 --> 20:41.833
After all, he's earned the right.

20:41.916 --> 20:43.166
Thanks to him

20:43.250 --> 20:44.625
that we're swimming in cash!

20:45.208 --> 20:46.916
Let's say he's within his rights,

20:47.500 --> 20:48.875
but the girl is just 16.

20:48.958 --> 20:50.375
She's a fucking child!

20:55.416 --> 20:56.833
Forget about children.

20:57.583 --> 20:59.000
He can also fuck my mother

20:59.083 --> 21:00.291
with my blessings.

21:00.833 --> 21:01.958
He brings in big bucks!

21:02.625 --> 21:05.791
Stop overthinking!
Those girls you're talking about?

21:06.583 --> 21:08.416
They're gonna be whores eventually.

21:09.083 --> 21:10.250
I'll say…

21:11.083 --> 21:12.500
we break them in early.

21:17.416 --> 21:19.000
She killed herself.

21:19.583 --> 21:21.041
Did you know that?

21:25.000 --> 21:28.375
If the cops come knocking,
don't ask me for shit.

21:29.000 --> 21:31.416
I start to feel you're just a little bitch
like Hoang,

21:31.500 --> 21:34.541
hiding behind his wife's skirts all
the time and couldn't do a shit.

21:34.625 --> 21:36.958
All right, this is my turf!
I'll handle it!

21:54.166 --> 21:56.000
What's wrong? Can't sleep?

22:02.541 --> 22:06.000
I couldn't sleep when I first came here
either. Every time I closed my eyes,

22:06.083 --> 22:07.875
I saw my haunted past.

22:07.958 --> 22:09.791
Honey…

22:15.833 --> 22:17.750
She's dreaming
of fucking Dan Truong again.

22:19.083 --> 22:20.458
I don't dream.

22:22.625 --> 22:23.875
I'm just haunted by…

22:24.958 --> 22:26.166
the darkness.

22:29.583 --> 22:31.916
People like us can never sleep well.

22:37.750 --> 22:39.000
Try listening to this.

22:39.083 --> 22:40.041
Might help you sleep.

22:40.916 --> 22:42.083
You'll get used to it.

23:09.875 --> 23:11.000
Where's my bra, Thanh?

23:11.083 --> 23:12.416
Why don't you ask Jacqueline?

23:12.500 --> 23:14.791
-You always ask me.
-No way. I wouldn't dare.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.541
That's a wild daisy.
They bloom around here a lot.

23:20.625 --> 23:22.666
They are said to be
the symbol of resilience,

23:22.750 --> 23:24.750
surviving in the harshest conditions.

23:43.291 --> 23:44.833
God, you scared me.

23:46.666 --> 23:49.500
I just got back from Hoang Phap Pagoda.
And got you this charm.

23:49.583 --> 23:52.250
It will bring you peace.

23:52.333 --> 23:53.458
Put it on.

23:54.166 --> 23:56.375
And you will sleep very well

23:56.458 --> 23:58.500
and dream
about going to school, all right?

24:00.000 --> 24:01.166
Thank you, Sau.

24:01.666 --> 24:03.083
I'll never take it off.

24:38.875 --> 24:40.875
You don't have to train today.

24:40.958 --> 24:42.625
I have a mission for you.

24:42.708 --> 24:45.500
Bi, this is your first chance
to prove yourself.

24:48.791 --> 24:50.875
Your first target is Michael.

24:51.458 --> 24:55.041
This guy is Hai's
new drug manufacturer and provider.

24:59.000 --> 25:00.250
Hey! What are you doing?

25:04.583 --> 25:06.333
Bi, you're up!

25:10.916 --> 25:13.041
I asked you to fix Michael up
with some girls.

25:14.708 --> 25:16.083
And now he's left town,

25:17.000 --> 25:18.833
no longer wants to do business with us.

25:18.916 --> 25:21.000
I've been courting his deal for a year

25:21.500 --> 25:23.166
and you threw it all away.

25:24.291 --> 25:28.333
-What am I going to do with you?
-Boss… please…

25:28.416 --> 25:29.750
It's not my fault.

25:30.416 --> 25:33.625
-Those bitches. It's theirs!
-Just a few little girls,

25:33.708 --> 25:36.500
but you still couldn't handle it.
It really is your fault.

25:38.916 --> 25:40.833
-Come in.
-Your medicine.

25:41.916 --> 25:45.791
It's probably Huong's gang.
She's always been hungry for your turf.

25:46.916 --> 25:48.375
All right.

25:48.458 --> 25:49.583
If she's hungry,

25:50.666 --> 25:51.625
I'll feed her.

25:51.708 --> 25:54.875
-Congrats, boss!
-Boss, congrats on getting this turf!

26:07.208 --> 26:10.000
Huong is out of the picture.
We have to change our plan.

26:10.083 --> 26:13.250
And we must act now
because our cover is blown.

26:13.333 --> 26:15.583
From now on,
it's gonna be much more dangerous.

26:15.666 --> 26:18.000
Don't worry. We're all ready.

26:19.625 --> 26:20.833
This is a large shipment.

26:20.916 --> 26:22.958
We need to move fast before the pigs come.

26:23.041 --> 26:25.208
-Are you confident?
-You don't need to worry.

26:25.291 --> 26:27.583
If these goods
are as high-grade as you say,

26:27.666 --> 26:31.583
it's not gonna be a problem.
My clients can pay to play.

26:31.666 --> 26:33.500
Money… is not a big deal.

26:34.208 --> 26:35.333
Wow.

26:36.333 --> 26:40.541
You move it fast,
we're going to make a big score!

26:44.416 --> 26:45.500
Hai.

26:45.583 --> 26:50.125
Remember, you have to be prestigious
if you want to do business with me.

26:50.208 --> 26:53.166
If something goes south
with this shipment,

26:53.250 --> 26:55.666
you'll give me Nancy Market's territory!

26:59.083 --> 27:01.541
-Sir, please buy something…
-Hello.

27:01.625 --> 27:05.083
I'll come to talk to "Skinhead" Lam.
You can handle the ice factory.

27:05.166 --> 27:07.333
What? How can I take care of them…

27:07.416 --> 27:10.416
What the fuck are you afraid of those
Xom Cai goons?

27:12.166 --> 27:13.125
It's 2,000 dong, sir.

27:13.208 --> 27:16.750
Hai's having a deal
with the Xom Cai boss, A Thoong.

27:16.833 --> 27:19.541
If it goes through,
it'll pave the way for them

27:19.625 --> 27:21.666
to lay their hands on even more girls.

27:21.750 --> 27:23.583
We have to stop them at all costs.

27:23.666 --> 27:26.041
-Hurry up!
-Climb up!

27:26.125 --> 27:27.083
Step up!

27:27.166 --> 27:28.166
Tomorrow at 11:00 p.m.,

27:28.250 --> 27:30.916
they're gonna take the girls
to Phong Van Port in Cau Kho.

27:31.000 --> 27:33.666
They will choose and rate the girls there

27:33.750 --> 27:36.000
and move them to the brothels.

27:36.708 --> 27:39.791
Nguyen Thi Le Mai, 16 years old,
raped, then murdered.

27:40.625 --> 27:42.041
The person who did this is Teo.

27:42.125 --> 27:45.000
He's also the one in charge
of "Mad Dog" Hai's brothel business.

27:45.083 --> 27:46.208
I know him.

27:46.291 --> 27:48.875
-How come?
-I was sold into one of his brothels.

27:48.958 --> 27:51.666
You have no idea
how he has harmed many girls.

27:51.750 --> 27:52.666
Right.

27:53.500 --> 27:54.375
It's time…

27:55.041 --> 27:56.416
we made them pay.

28:06.250 --> 28:07.666
Hurry up! Get in here!

28:08.625 --> 28:10.666
Get in here!

28:10.750 --> 28:11.625
Quickly!

28:11.708 --> 28:13.083
Shut your mouths!

28:13.166 --> 28:14.500
Let me go!

28:14.583 --> 28:16.541
Ut! Ut!

28:16.625 --> 28:18.750
-Help me!
-Ut!

28:23.000 --> 28:25.291
Sir! Please, sir, spare me!

28:30.458 --> 28:31.500
Double three!

28:31.583 --> 28:32.625
Double four!

28:32.708 --> 28:33.750
Win.

28:50.416 --> 28:52.666
Sir, please! I'm begging you!

28:54.083 --> 28:55.250
Sir…

28:55.333 --> 28:56.875
Please spare me, sir!

29:23.500 --> 29:25.333
Thank you.

29:27.166 --> 29:28.500
Please help my sister!

29:29.083 --> 29:30.250
Shut up!

29:31.625 --> 29:32.458
Fuck you.

29:33.291 --> 29:35.291
Shut up, or I'll break your necks!

29:37.208 --> 29:39.583
Jeez, such a terrible person!

29:39.666 --> 29:42.750
You go to the other room.
I want to save these girls.

30:03.416 --> 30:08.083
This is Grade-A stuff.
Why the fuck do you have to test it?

30:09.041 --> 30:09.916
All right?

30:10.666 --> 30:13.333
Are you trying to say
A Thoong doesn't trust our boss, Hai?

30:13.416 --> 30:16.000
You know, here in this turf,

30:16.083 --> 30:19.416
if Hai doesn't have the good stuff,
none of those fuckers out there does.

30:21.125 --> 30:21.958
Hey!

32:40.208 --> 32:43.000
There's an important briefcase there.
Bring it back to me.

32:43.666 --> 32:45.625
The place is on fire!
Let's get out of here!

33:37.291 --> 33:39.291
Thanh, speed up!

33:56.333 --> 33:58.333
Bi, what's wrong? Hurry up.

33:58.416 --> 33:59.833
You look tired.

34:02.041 --> 34:04.666
Thanh, you eventually
took revenge on them.

34:04.750 --> 34:06.416
I'm so happy for you.

34:07.625 --> 34:09.500
Aunt Lin, mission accomplished.

34:09.583 --> 34:12.250
The ice factory is finished,
and Teo is dead.

34:13.666 --> 34:16.708
-Very good.
-Excuse me, I have to go to my room.

34:16.791 --> 34:18.750
What's wrong with her?

34:18.833 --> 34:20.375
Is she okay?

34:52.041 --> 34:53.416
Bi.

34:56.000 --> 34:56.833
Bi.

34:58.875 --> 35:00.041
Bi!

35:01.416 --> 35:03.583
Bi. It's me! It's me, Thanh! Bi!

35:11.083 --> 35:12.083
Bi!

35:17.916 --> 35:19.041
Bi!

35:19.750 --> 35:21.708
Bi… calm down!

35:21.791 --> 35:22.708
Bi!

35:23.541 --> 35:24.416
Bi!

35:30.750 --> 35:31.875
Bi!

36:05.833 --> 36:07.416
Except for Huong's gang,

36:08.666 --> 36:10.583
who would dare to do it?

36:11.916 --> 36:13.041
How many of them?

36:13.125 --> 36:14.000
Tell me.

36:15.083 --> 36:17.291
-Tell me!
-There were… three girls.

36:17.916 --> 36:19.083
What?

36:21.083 --> 36:23.416
Sir, there were… three girls.

36:30.833 --> 36:33.125
Three girls?
And somehow they broke in here,

36:33.208 --> 36:36.125
killed Teo, and burnt my place down?
Motherfucker!

36:40.750 --> 36:44.625
What the fuck were you guys doing?
I told you this is a big deal.

36:45.416 --> 36:46.750
What are we gonna do?

36:46.833 --> 36:47.833
Huh?

36:49.208 --> 36:50.583
What's wrong with you?

36:51.208 --> 36:55.125
I was taking care of "Skinhead" Lam
yesterday, don't you remember?

37:01.333 --> 37:03.416
Please spare us…

37:11.750 --> 37:13.750
What kind of business are you running?

37:13.833 --> 37:17.333
The goods didn't arrived,
and my two men vanished into thin air.

37:17.416 --> 37:19.416
-The way you're doing business…
-A Thoong…

37:19.500 --> 37:23.000
Let's just say I had bad luck this time.
Nancy Market is now yours.

37:23.083 --> 37:24.333
Not that easy.

37:24.416 --> 37:27.208
It goes without saying
Nancy Market is now mine.

37:27.291 --> 37:29.250
But also you still have
to deliver my goods.

37:29.333 --> 37:31.500
I'll give you three days.

37:31.583 --> 37:34.166
Otherwise,
I'll storm the rest of your turf.

37:37.166 --> 37:39.416
Find those motherfuckers for me!

37:39.500 --> 37:42.208
Cheers! Happy birthday, Hong!

37:43.666 --> 37:46.875
This is the first time someone's
thrown a birthday party for me, Sau.

37:46.958 --> 37:47.791
Isn't it?

37:47.875 --> 37:49.375
Thank you, Sau.

37:50.916 --> 37:52.291
It's spicy, don't stir it up.

37:52.375 --> 37:55.666
-Did you make this porridge, Sau?
-Hey, cheer up, it's my birthday.

37:55.750 --> 37:57.250
-Very delicious!
-The truth is…

37:57.333 --> 38:00.666
I never thought there'd be so many people
celebrating my birthday.

38:00.750 --> 38:03.250
Cheer up.

38:03.333 --> 38:05.083
Blow out the candle and make a wish!

38:05.166 --> 38:06.458
HAPPY 19TH BIRTHDAY
THU HONG

38:07.916 --> 38:08.833
Happy birthday.

38:09.750 --> 38:11.041
Say something.

38:13.958 --> 38:17.875
Thanks to you guys,
I learned to be strong,

38:18.833 --> 38:21.833
to protect myself
and women who are weaker than me.

38:22.958 --> 38:24.125
I have…

38:25.416 --> 38:28.250
found happiness when I'm with you.

38:28.333 --> 38:29.416
I wish that…

38:30.750 --> 38:31.833
from now on,

38:31.916 --> 38:36.166
we will always be a family,

38:37.000 --> 38:39.916
that we'll always love
and protect each other.

38:41.208 --> 38:43.208
Why are you so cheesy all of a sudden?

38:44.833 --> 38:46.166
-No, she's not.
-Sit down.

38:46.250 --> 38:48.000
I'd wish the same.

38:48.583 --> 38:51.500
If everyone were happy like you,

38:51.583 --> 38:53.458
that'd be a good enough life.

38:53.541 --> 38:55.333
Cheers!

38:55.416 --> 38:56.916
Cheers!

38:57.000 --> 38:59.708
-Cheers. Happy birthday!
-You are the happiest.

39:03.750 --> 39:06.708
Aunty, thanks to Bi,
we completed the mission yesterday.

39:06.791 --> 39:10.291
She was quick and vicious like a wolf.
I was surprised.

39:10.916 --> 39:13.583
Well, it was because
Thanh knew how to protect her pack.

39:13.666 --> 39:16.083
-I was just following her lead.
-Good.

39:16.166 --> 39:18.500
You girls must stick together.

39:18.583 --> 39:21.416
Then no one will be able to break you up.
You understand?

39:21.500 --> 39:24.375
Hey, you two wolves, what about me?

39:25.375 --> 39:28.291
-I'm a fierce, sexy wolf too…
-Can I have some more, please?

39:28.375 --> 39:29.666
I was there, too.

39:29.750 --> 39:33.083
-Here.
-Come on, you guys…

39:33.166 --> 39:34.666
Aunt Lin and everyone

39:34.750 --> 39:37.125
has shown me the warmth of a family.

39:37.208 --> 39:38.458
Here's your chicken.

39:38.541 --> 39:41.458
-Thanh, how about my birthday gift?
-Your chicken.

39:43.166 --> 39:45.250
Hong is too clumsy, Sau.

39:45.333 --> 39:47.375
But there is a part of me

39:48.208 --> 39:50.416
that's not fully ready to embrace it.

40:05.333 --> 40:06.666
It's been five years.

40:07.375 --> 40:09.500
Time does fly.

40:09.583 --> 40:12.250
Every time it rains, I miss Hoang.

40:13.000 --> 40:15.000
Tomorrow is his death anniversary.

40:15.583 --> 40:18.125
I still remember every time it rained,

40:18.208 --> 40:20.750
he'd ask me to make him

40:20.833 --> 40:23.750
a bowl of noodles
with a lot of pork cracklings.

40:23.833 --> 40:25.333
He'd wolf it down

40:25.416 --> 40:26.666
and then yelled out,

40:26.750 --> 40:29.958
"Your noodles are the best,
your noodles are the best."

40:30.583 --> 40:34.500
Thanks to it, I raised him and Long
until they're grown-ups.

40:35.583 --> 40:36.833
But now,

40:36.916 --> 40:39.250
even if I make the best noodle soup,

40:39.333 --> 40:41.250
Hoang couldn't eat it anymore.

40:45.250 --> 40:46.750
They got rid of Huong.

40:46.833 --> 40:49.583
Hai is turning the town upside down,
searching for the girls.

40:49.666 --> 40:52.791
He had to give up Nancy Market
to A Thoong to save face.

40:52.875 --> 40:54.291
And the death of Teo,

40:55.583 --> 40:56.916
he's furious.

40:57.000 --> 41:00.916
I think from now on, you should
consider your next move carefully.

41:03.083 --> 41:04.541
Or you can just drop it.

41:05.166 --> 41:07.041
It's been such a long time.

41:07.125 --> 41:09.166
What happened was fate.

41:09.916 --> 41:12.333
Your life is also not bad now.

41:12.416 --> 41:14.083
Let's just start over.

41:14.166 --> 41:17.666
You… keep putting yourself
back in that world…

41:18.750 --> 41:20.416
it makes me worried.

41:21.333 --> 41:22.958
If anything happens to you…

41:23.916 --> 41:26.083
how am I gonna live on?

41:26.166 --> 41:28.916
It's raining so I made some tea for you.

41:29.000 --> 41:32.000
Is it strong?
I don't want to stay up tonight.

41:32.083 --> 41:33.833
It's lighter than yesterday.

42:23.833 --> 42:24.750
Honey?

42:25.916 --> 42:28.916
I want the two of us
to have a new future together.

42:30.500 --> 42:32.083
Ever since I met you…

42:35.583 --> 42:37.541
I've grown to despise this way of life.

42:38.916 --> 42:40.291
Just give me some time.

42:43.791 --> 42:45.958
After having paid off my debt
for this life,

42:47.666 --> 42:49.416
I will give you a new life.

43:04.083 --> 43:05.625
Have you ever wondered

43:06.291 --> 43:08.625
if what we are doing is right or wrong?

43:09.333 --> 43:10.541
Why do you ask?

43:14.416 --> 43:17.375
-Since I killed Teo…
-You were scared, weren't you?

43:18.041 --> 43:20.041
Everyone feels the same
for their first time.

43:20.125 --> 43:21.041
No.

43:21.916 --> 43:23.250
I liked it.

43:23.833 --> 43:27.041
And I was afraid of myself… liking it.

43:27.625 --> 43:28.708
That feeling…

43:30.500 --> 43:32.333
made me feel free,

43:34.416 --> 43:36.541
I can drown in my own darkness.

43:36.625 --> 43:39.125
But there's still something inside of me

43:39.208 --> 43:40.583
screaming out…

43:41.541 --> 43:42.750
that it's not right.

43:46.625 --> 43:47.958
You know what?

43:48.041 --> 43:51.416
If killing people makes the world
a better place, then I'll do it.

43:51.500 --> 43:54.416
Is it our world that's better,
or just Aunt Lin's?

43:57.500 --> 43:58.416
What do you mean?

44:01.166 --> 44:02.708
What's in that briefcase you took?

44:11.208 --> 44:12.625
See the kids down there?

44:15.125 --> 44:16.916
That used to be my world.

44:17.000 --> 44:18.250
QUARTER 5

44:18.333 --> 44:20.125
It was dark and shameful.

44:20.208 --> 44:22.833
I couldn't take it anymore,
so I risked my life to escape.

44:24.083 --> 44:25.541
I just wanted to die back then.

44:26.375 --> 44:29.750
Then Aunt Lin brought me here,
gave me a new life,

44:29.833 --> 44:32.166
and taught me how to live with purpose.

44:32.250 --> 44:35.958
It's like I was reborn, thanks to her.
So I choose to trust her.

44:36.750 --> 44:39.125
And I believe what we're doing is right.

44:42.333 --> 44:44.000
You know why I'm still here?

44:45.833 --> 44:47.625
Because you make me feel like…

44:48.750 --> 44:50.041
a family.

44:52.916 --> 44:55.416
You remind me of my younger sister, Thao.

44:56.333 --> 44:57.291
Where's she now?

45:02.041 --> 45:04.875
By the way, if we're a family now,

45:05.583 --> 45:07.250
then no matter what happens,

45:08.000 --> 45:10.333
we'll always stay together. Promise me.

45:11.333 --> 45:12.666
Except my mom,

45:13.833 --> 45:15.333
there's only you with me.

45:15.916 --> 45:16.833
Hey!

45:16.916 --> 45:17.916
What about me?

45:21.083 --> 45:22.250
And Hong.

45:22.333 --> 45:24.958
I thought you had forgotten me.

45:25.041 --> 45:25.875
Give me that.

45:29.625 --> 45:30.875
No matter what,

45:30.958 --> 45:32.666
we'll always be sisters.

45:32.750 --> 45:35.791
Together forever. To our new future!

45:35.875 --> 45:37.000
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

45:43.083 --> 45:45.375
Goodbye

45:45.458 --> 45:50.750
Don't look back to that sinful life

45:50.833 --> 45:51.666
Goodbye

47:00.208 --> 47:02.083
We all have our own story.

47:03.000 --> 47:04.333
We all have our loss.

47:04.916 --> 47:09.708
That night, we were the women of our fate,
leaning on one another

47:10.541 --> 47:11.833
like blood sisters,

47:12.666 --> 47:14.916
trying to forget the painful memories

47:15.666 --> 47:17.250
and the haunting traumas.

47:47.041 --> 47:52.750
THREE PEOPLE FOUND DEAD TRAGICALLY
IN THEIR HOME

48:11.291 --> 48:13.000
We were like wildflowers,

48:13.916 --> 48:16.208
trying to rise up in the dark.

48:53.083 --> 48:54.875
So, Jacqueline is still alive?

48:56.583 --> 48:57.541
Right?

48:58.250 --> 48:59.250
Where is she?

49:00.250 --> 49:02.625
-I don't know.
-Where is she?

49:02.708 --> 49:04.583
-Where is she hiding?
-I don't know.

49:04.666 --> 49:06.291
Fucker!

49:12.208 --> 49:14.125
Motherfucker!

49:15.708 --> 49:18.166
A rat, wise as it is,

49:18.250 --> 49:20.458
can't resist the perfect bait.

49:22.333 --> 49:24.375
Our final target is "Mad Dog" Hai.

49:25.208 --> 49:28.083
Finish him,
and we'll save hundreds of girls.

49:28.166 --> 49:30.875
Every night,
Hai ends up at the New Century Club.

49:30.958 --> 49:34.625
It's a brothel in disguise
to pimp out the girls they kidnap.

49:34.708 --> 49:38.041
Easy-peasy. We'll just take care of it
like we did the ice factory, right?

49:38.125 --> 49:39.416
It's not gonna be that easy.

49:39.500 --> 49:43.166
Hai's not afraid to show his face there,
that means the place is absolutely safe.

49:43.250 --> 49:45.250
That's right. The club is heavily guarded.

49:45.333 --> 49:48.166
His favorite spot is the VIP section
on the second floor.

49:48.250 --> 49:51.875
This area is off-limits
except for his underlings and servers.

49:51.958 --> 49:54.250
Hai has one weakness… Women.

49:54.833 --> 49:57.583
And you three
are the perfect baits for him.

50:06.000 --> 50:06.958
New merch?

50:07.041 --> 50:09.958
Madame Lan brought her in.
She's the hottest at Pink Night Club.

50:11.333 --> 50:14.458
I don't fucking care where she comes from,
but she has to be mine.

50:15.875 --> 50:17.375
Honey, what about me?

50:19.375 --> 50:21.708
-What the fuck?
-I'm sorry.

50:22.583 --> 50:23.833
I'm sorry.

50:36.875 --> 50:38.125
Apology not accepted.

50:39.166 --> 50:40.500
Finish this.

50:46.458 --> 50:47.791
Wow!

50:50.041 --> 50:52.791
Isn't today… Hoang's death anniversary?

50:53.416 --> 50:54.583
Son told me that

50:54.666 --> 50:56.333
Jacqueline is still alive.

50:57.208 --> 50:59.291
She's back to avenge her husband's death.

51:00.666 --> 51:02.750
Now, tell me…
why would she still be alive?

51:02.833 --> 51:06.750
I saw her in the morgue with my own eyes.
You don't believe me now?

51:11.000 --> 51:12.708
I never said I don't believe you.

51:12.791 --> 51:14.291
I killed her once.

51:14.833 --> 51:16.750
Even if she got ten more lives

51:16.833 --> 51:18.208
I still can kill her.

51:19.166 --> 51:20.666
What can a woman like her

51:22.500 --> 51:24.083
do to me?

51:30.416 --> 51:32.791
I'll go celebrate his death anniversary.

52:20.958 --> 52:24.416
You like it rough, huh?

52:24.500 --> 52:26.750
You want this? Huh? Like this?

52:31.125 --> 52:32.875
Scream! Give it your best, bitch.

52:32.958 --> 52:34.625
Fuck you!

52:53.416 --> 52:54.791
You're so fucking dead.

53:08.583 --> 53:09.416
Bi.

53:09.500 --> 53:10.666
Men!

53:15.541 --> 53:17.583
Kill those two bitches!

53:19.541 --> 53:21.750
Long, get the car!

53:22.833 --> 53:23.833
Now!

55:09.833 --> 55:11.750
Hey, got any money?

55:11.833 --> 55:13.000
Lend me some, will you?

55:35.208 --> 55:36.750
Hong!

56:40.416 --> 56:43.416
Choose a new life for yourself.

56:55.250 --> 56:56.541
I love you.

01:01:13.083 --> 01:01:14.916
Why are you driving like that!

01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:18.000
Why are you driving like crazy?
Do you even have eyes?

01:01:21.166 --> 01:01:22.166
Hey!

01:01:46.916 --> 01:01:48.833
Goal!

01:03:00.500 --> 01:03:02.750
Hello! You want some noodles?

01:03:02.833 --> 01:03:04.791
Sir, we are open at 6:00 a.m.

01:03:04.875 --> 01:03:07.541
Please come back later, I'm sorry.

01:03:41.708 --> 01:03:42.541
Aunt Lin!

01:03:42.625 --> 01:03:44.791
-Come out here, Aunt Lin!
-Bi!

01:03:44.875 --> 01:03:45.833
Bi.

01:03:47.041 --> 01:03:48.250
Bi, calm down.

01:03:50.541 --> 01:03:53.666
What's all this?
What's the story between you and Hai?

01:03:54.666 --> 01:03:58.416
-Where is Hong? Why it's just you two?
-This assassination…

01:03:58.500 --> 01:04:03.750
wasn't to fight for any bullshit justice.
It was to take revenge for you, wasn't it?

01:04:03.833 --> 01:04:04.708
Aunt Lin,

01:04:05.791 --> 01:04:07.375
what is Bi talking about?

01:04:08.833 --> 01:04:11.250
Where is Hong? Huh? Answer me!

01:04:12.583 --> 01:04:16.708
She's dead. She died for the false ideals
that you brainwashed us with!

01:04:16.791 --> 01:04:17.791
Say something!

01:04:21.250 --> 01:04:22.541
Why did she die?

01:04:25.750 --> 01:04:28.291
I've been planning this for a year.

01:04:28.375 --> 01:04:30.083
Every detail.

01:04:30.791 --> 01:04:32.041
What went wrong?

01:04:34.250 --> 01:04:36.791
-Why don't you answer me?
-What did you say?

01:04:36.875 --> 01:04:39.666
You want us to kill Hai to avenge
your husband, am I right?

01:04:39.750 --> 01:04:40.750
Shut up!

01:04:41.708 --> 01:04:44.625
You know nothing
about my husband, all right?

01:04:44.708 --> 01:04:46.958
