01:24:14.916 --> 01:24:18.041
You sent me on a fool's errand to Lin's.
Motherfucking snitch!

01:25:23.791 --> 01:25:24.958
Fuck you!

01:26:28.708 --> 01:26:30.041
Looking for Son?

01:26:44.416 --> 01:26:45.416
